<title>GERMANY: TABLE TENNIS-RESULTS FROM EUROPEAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-RESULTS FROM EUROPEAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSRUHE, Germany 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from European</p>
<p>Nations Cup tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Sweden beat France 3-0</p>
<p>Belgium beat Germany 3-0</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>Sweden beat Belgium 3-0</p>
</text>
